{
  "job_C16.3_20251003_115218": {
    "text": "Luna prima quicquid uideris, in gaudium erit, et si uideris te uinci, tu tamen uinces omnes inimicos tuos\nLuna ii si uideris somnium, nullum effectum habet, nec in animo ponas siue bonum siue malum gif \u00feu\nLuna iii, qualis et secunda ealswilc swilce se o\u00f0er.\nLuna iiii bonum effectum habet, nichil nocet gode gefremminge h\u00e6f\u00f0 naht ne dera\u00f0.\nLuna v sicut et quarta eallswa se feor\u00fea.\nLuna vi, secundum quod uideris, ita tibi fiet. Secretum consilium extraneis noli proferre \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fee \u00feu\nLuna vii quicquid uideris, post multum tempus fiet swahw\u00e6tswa \u00feu gesihst \u00e6fter langum timan hit\nLuna viii, certa sunt omnia gewisse sint ealle.\nLuna viiii, inter duos dies euenit binnan twan dagum gelimp\u00f0.\nLuna x quicquid somniaueris, nullum effectum malum habet swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee swefnast nane\nLuna xi, falsa sunt omnia lease sint ealle.\nLuna xii, certa sunt omnia gewisse sint ealle.\nLuna xiii, qualis xii eallswilc.\nLuna xiiii, effectum habet breuis temporis gefremminge h\u00e6f\u00f0 scortes timan.\nLuna xv, qualis xiiii eallswilc.\nLuna xvi, post multum tempus fiet \u00e6fter langum timan hit gewyr\u00f0.\nLuna xvii, post dies xi eueniet \u00e6fter dagum endlufon hit gelimp\u00f0.\nLuna xviii, inter xx dies continget binnon twentigum dagum hit getima\u00f0.\nLuna xix, inter dies iiii eueniet binnon dagum feower hit gelimp\u00f0.\nLuna xx, ne tu dixeris somnium tuum intra dies vii sed obserua certitudinem ne \u00feu sege swefn \u00fein\nLuna xxi, sicut et xx eallswa uigessima.\nLuna xxii quicquid uideris, certum est ad gaudium pertinere swahw\u00e6tswa \u00feu gesihst gewiss his to\nLuna xxiii, rixalis contentio inter dies iii eueniet sacful geflit binnon dagum \u00ferim gelimp\u00f0.\nLuna xxiiii quicquid uideris, de salute tua erit swahw\u00e6tswa \u00feu gesihst be hele \u00feine hit bi\u00f0.\nLuna xxv metus futurus inter dies viii \u00e6ge towyrd binnon dagum ehta.\nLuna xxvi, inter dies uiginti eueniet binnon dagum twentigum hit gelimp\u00f0.\nLuna xxvii sicut et xxvi eallswa.\nLuna xxviii et xxix, omne gaudium significat et omnem angustiam hilaris aufert ealle blisse tacna\u00f0 &\nLuna xxx infra triduum fiet somnium tuum sine periculo. Amen binnon \u00ferim dagum gewyr\u00f0 swefn \u00fein",
